"session</action>. The name is displayed on the session tab. <keycombo action="
"\"simul\">&Alt;&Ctrl;<keycap>S</keycap> </keycombo> can also be used."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: menuchoice
#: index.docbook:764
#, no-c-format
msgid "<guimenu>View</guimenu><guimenuitem>Monitor for Activity</guimenuitem>"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:766
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<action>Flag the current session so it will show an alert if activity "
"occurs</action>. An icon of a lit light bulb will appear in the session's "
"tab. Use this to alert you if something happens while you are working in "
"another session. The time before an alert can be modified in the &konsole; "
"preferences."
msgstr ""

