#: index.docbook:776
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<action>Flag the current session so it will show an alert if no activity "
"occurs for 10 seconds</action>. An icon of a dark light bulb will appear in "
"the session's tab. Use this to alert you if a task stops while you are "
"working in another session. The time before an alert can be modified in the "
"&konsole; preferences."
msgstr ""

